# The build context for `deploy/gcp/Dockerfile` is the repository root — see
# `deploy/gcp/docker-compose.yml`'s `context: ../..` — because the sidecar is
# compiled from this crate's source rather than pulled from a registry.
# Without this file the context is whatever the working tree happens to hold;
# `target/` alone runs to several GB, and every `docker build` uploads the
# whole context to the daemon before the first instruction runs.
target/
.git/
captures/
